Cell["\<\
Finite equations (at this point, fix 4th order of the scalar potential to get \
rid of logs, and source of scalar to be constant, just because otherwise the \
following starts taking impossibly long)\
\>", "Chapter",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.619258581099161*^9, 3.619258585721744*^9}, {
