Cell["\<\
Before to give our equations to simpy, whatever they are, we need to follow \
some steps first:
- Redefinition of inner or outer grid (replcts or Arepl and Frepl)
- Apply the redefinition of differential operators through BSTRules and \
rewritespatialderivative
- Change from r to u coordinate\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9089593136292*^9, 
  3.9089594428246927`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"02390498-8b25-4b97-892c-\
4e9eb6e8d385"],

